<title>UK: Deutsche Bau- und Bodenbank sets 300 mln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bau- und Bodenbank sets 300 mln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BAU- UND BODENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 MAR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/8 PCT   PAY DATE  S-03.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.91     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
